@startuml
!include _style.puml
title Brief lifecycle (BriefStatus)
[*] --> draft : validation green
[*] --> escalated : retry budget spent,\nwith diagnosis
draft --> published : approve / edit\n(named approver)
escalated --> published : approve with acknowledgement\n(completeness failures V2, V3, V8 only)
draft --> overridden : override (reason)
escalated --> overridden : override (reason)
draft --> returned : send back (reason)
escalated --> returned : send back (reason)
published --> rolled_back : rollback to an earlier version\n(reason, nothing deleted)
note right of escalated : an integrity failure (V1, V4, V5,\nV6, V7, V9) can never be approved
@enduml
